TI  - CulturePark: Boosting Cross-cultural Understanding in Large Language Models
AU  - Li, C.
AU  - Teney, D.
AU  - Yang, L.
AU  - Wen, Q.
AU  - Xie, X.
AU  - Wang, J.
T2  - Advances in Neural Information Processing Systems
